## 4. North-star user journeys

> **عربي:** قسم — 4.1 Two products, one Vigil window

### 4.1 Two products, one Vigil window

1. User opens `VigilAIAgent` as workspace.  
2. User **Add Git Repository…** (or Add Folder to Workspace) → picks `Vigil-AI-Agent-Web`.  
3. Source Control shows two tabs: **VigilAIAgent** (color A) · **Vigil-AI-Agent-Web** (color B).  
4. User selects Web tab → sees only web changes → commits on Web branch.  
5. Switches to Desktop tab → desktop commit box / graph.  
6. Titles stay **pinned / always visible** as tabs — never lost under a long file list.

> **عربي:** قسم — 4.2 Quick glance

### 4.2 Quick glance

- Each tab shows dirty badge (count of changes) + optional branch name chip.  
- Active tab = filled color bar / bold title; inactive = muted with same hue accent.

