## 6. Data model (conceptual)

```text
ScmRepo {
  id: string                 // stable (hash of absolute path)
  rootPath: string           // absolute Git root
  displayName: string        // folder basename or override
  color: string              // CSS color token / hex from palette
  branch?: string
  ahead?: number
  behind?: number
  changeCount?: number
  isPrimary?: boolean        // maps to explorer / agent cwd when true
}

ScmState {
  repos: ScmRepo[]
  activeRepoId: string | null
}
```

Persist under local settings / `localStorage` `vigil.scm.repos.v1` (paths + UI state only — no secrets, no full file contents in cloud). Another workspace = another Vigil window, not an in-app session bag.

