## 7. Discovery & registration

| Mode | Behavior |
|------|----------|
| Open folder | If folder is a Git root → register as SCM repo (current behavior + tab) |
| Add repo | Dialog pick folder; require `.git` (or offer `git init`) |
| Nested | Phase 1: only the folder user added; don’t auto-scan entire disk |
| Multi-root workspace (later) | If Vigil gains multi-folder Explorer, each folder that is a Git root becomes a tab |

