## 8. Per-tab behavior (must mirror today’s single-repo SCM)

For the **active** repo only:

- ✅ Fetch status / stage / unstage / commit / push / pull / sync  
- ✅ Changes tree + Agent Review section if present  
- ✅ Graph view  
- ✅ Branches view  
- ✅ AI commit message / review helpers use **that** repo’s diff  

Switching tabs:

- ✅ Cancel or ignore in-flight status for previous tab safely  
- ✅ Restore scroll / draft commit message **per repo** (persist draft in memory or local)   

