## 9. Integration with the rest of Vigil

| Area | Rule |
|------|------|
| **Explorer / agent cwd** | Phase 1: primary workspace remains one path; optional “Set as primary” from SCM tab |
| **StatusBar** | Show active SCM repo name + branch (colored dot) |
| **Agent tools** | Still default to primary workspace; later: tool arg `repoId` / path when user @-mentions another root |
| **Plan Mode** | Plans stay under primary `.vigil/plans/` unless plan hints name another root |
| **Cloud Bridge** | Unrelated — do not upload repo contents |

