## 10. Security & guardrails

- ✅ Only paths the user explicitly opened/added  
- ✅ Git commands always `cwd = activeRepo.rootPath` — never mix  
- ✅ Confirm destructive ops with **repo displayName** in the dialog title  
- ✅ No cross-repo `git add -A` by accident   

