## 12. Acceptance criteria

- ✅ User can open/add ≥2 Git repos and see **two colored tabs** in Source Control  
- ✅ Changing files list / commit / graph always matches the **active tab only**  
- ✅ Tab titles remain visible (not buried under a long Changes list)  
- ✅ Closing a tab removes it from SCM without deleting the folder  
- ✅ Restart restores tabs + colors + last active repo  
- ✅ Impossible (by UI) to commit repo A’s message into repo B without switching tabs   

