## 15. Non-goals / guardrails

- Not cloning Cursor’s stacked multi-repo list as the primary UX  
- Not a full VS Code multi-root workspace clone in Phase A  
- Not uploading any repo to Firestore  
- Not merging two repos’ Changes into one list  
- **Not** an in-window project switcher / warm combo — another workspace = another Vigil window  

